trait-luam-enhanced-motorics-name = Enhanced Motorics
trait-luam-enhanced-motorics-desc = Your movements are precise and quick: timed actions take 30% less time.
trait-luam-synthetic-leukocytes-name = Synthetic Leukocytes
trait-luam-synthetic-leukocytes-desc = Blood loss deals 60% less damage and bleeding stops 3 times faster.
trait-luam-athletic-name = Athletic
trait-luam-athletic-desc = You move 10% faster and can't slip.
trait-luam-reinforced-endoskeleton-name = Reinforced Endoskeleton
trait-luam-reinforced-endoskeleton-desc = Your limbs take 33% more damage before they can be torn off.
trait-luam-fast-metabolism-name = Fast Metabolism
trait-luam-fast-metabolism-desc = Reagents in your blood are processed 25% faster.
trait-luam-fragile-bones-name = Fragile Bones
trait-luam-fragile-bones-desc = Your bones snap at the slightest blow. Your limbs take half as much damage before they can be torn off, even while they still work.
trait-luam-fur-allergy-name = Allergic
trait-luam-fur-allergy-desc = You are allergic to fur and feathers. Staying near furry species for long makes you cough and your eyes water, and even longer contact brings choking and anaphylactic shock. A hug with a furry counts as 30 seconds nearby at once. A mask or a hardsuit helmet protects you.
fur-allergy-mild = Your nose itches and your eyes water.
fur-allergy-severe = Your throat tightens, you can't breathe!
fur-allergy-shock = Your legs give out!
fur-allergy-gone = You can breathe easier.
